METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo training
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w1-s0-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270131
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
SUMMARY:Long ride 60 km steady\, HR ~140 (150 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 of 12 - Base\nADMIN FIRST: (1) book the certificato me
 dico agonistico - Italy legally requires an ECG-based sports medical on 
 the FITRI form\, and without it you are not issued a race pack. Schedule
  by February. (2) Pull your best 20-min power from Garmin/Strava history
 \, x0.95 = FTP. Every bike split below is a guess until you do. Swim goe
 s to FOUR short sessions - frequency beats volume\, fatigue compromises 
 motor learning. SESSION COUNT: 3 runs\, 3-4 swims\, 2 bikes\, 1 legs\, 6
  days with Thursday off. That is ~9-10 h/week\, which is INTERMEDIATE vo
 lume - MyProCoach's beginner 70.3 plan averages 7 h. If adherence slips\
 , scale to the beginner shape rather than abandoning weeks. CUT ORDER: (
 1) Monday easy run\, (2) the fourth swim\, (3) Wednesday legs. Never cut
  the long ride\, the long run\, or below three swims.\n83 days to IRONMA
 N 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
