SUMMARY:Long ride 90 km - full race distance\, fuelling rehearsal 60-70 g
 /h (205 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 7 of 12 - Build\nTARGET: 1900 m continuous. The cutoff n
 eeds only 3:41/100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breaststroke the whole th
 ing is permitted\, and you may hold a buoy or kayak to rest provided you
  make no forward progress. Knowing that is what stops the panic that act
 ually causes swim DNFs.\n41 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
