  test.\nOPEN WATER STARTS - the single highest-consequence item in this 
 plan. 90 of 120 sudden deaths in US triathlon occurred in the swim\, and
  the mechanism is cold-water panic\, not fitness. You should already hav
 e done 5-6 cold immersions over the winter\; this is where it gets appli
 ed in a wetsuit.\n26 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
