DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270404
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270405
SUMMARY:Long ride 90 km at race effort (200 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 10 of 12 - Peak\nFull dress rehearsal. Run plan is RUN/W
 ALK from km 0\, not as a fallback: 9 min run / 1 min walk blends to ~7:2
 4/km and beats an even-paced blow-up by minutes per km. The course gives
  you 3 loops x 7.03 km with 9 aid stations - walk every one\, 5-15 s\, 3
 -5 good gulps.\n20 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
