BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w12-s0-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270418
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270419
SUMMARY:Easy spin 40 km (90 min)
DESCRIPTION:Week 12 of 12 - Race\nRACE WEEK. Swim 1\,898 m single counter
 clockwise loop from Lighthouse Beach\, 4 turn buoys plus directional buo
 ys every 100 m - unusually easy to sight. SELF-SEEDED ROLLING START\, 3 
 athletes every 6 s: seed HONESTLY at 55-60 min\, you will start ~08:15-0
 8:30. Enter at the EDGE of your box. Water 15-17 C. Warm up in the water
  06:30-07:00 then stay warm for 90 min. Swim the first 200 m deliberatel
 y too slowly. CUT-OFFS: swim 1:10 (absolute - zero finishers in 19\,137 
 splits swam over 70:00)\, bike 5:30\, overall 8:30. TRANSITION IS ~1 KM 
 FROM THE SWIM START - two venues\, walk it Friday. Target 6:15-7:15. Ven
 ice is a fast race: M25-29 median is 5:12\, so you will be near the back
  of a quick field. That is fine.\n6 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
